Bundled fonts
-------------

The text-label feature embeds the following fonts, each licensed under the
SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). The full
licence text for each is kept alongside the font data in
casemaker-app/src/engine/fonts/licenses/. The font files are unmodified and
were obtained from the Google Fonts repository (https://github.com/google/fonts,
directory ofl/<family>/), where the OFL.txt shipped with each family matches the
licence string embedded in the font files themselves.

  Barlow (Regular, Bold)
    Copyright 2017 The Barlow Project Authors (https://github.com/jpt/barlow)
    SIL OFL 1.1 - casemaker-app/src/engine/fonts/licenses/Barlow-OFL.txt

  IBM Plex Mono (Regular, Bold)
    Copyright 2017 IBM Corp., with Reserved Font Name "Plex"
    SIL OFL 1.1 - casemaker-app/src/engine/fonts/licenses/IBMPlexMono-OFL.txt

  IBM Plex Serif (Regular, Bold)
    Copyright 2017 IBM Corp., with Reserved Font Name "Plex" (per OFL.txt; the
    font files' own copyright field reads "Copyright 2020 IBM Corp.")
    SIL OFL 1.1 - casemaker-app/src/engine/fonts/licenses/IBMPlexSerif-OFL.txt

The fonts are embedded as base64 in src/engine/fonts/bundledFontData.ts (generated
by scripts/gen-font-data.mjs) purely for runtime use; the font files are not
renamed or altered, so the Reserved Font Name provisions are not engaged.
Glyph outlines extracted from them for engraving are output geometry, not a
distribution of the Font Software.

Bundled stroke font (single-line engraving)
-------------------------------------------

The single-line engraving feature bundles the coordinate data of the Hershey
Roman Simplex ("rowmans") face, in the James Hurt distribution format, at
casemaker-app/src/engine/fonts/stroke/hersheySimplex.ts.

  The Hershey Fonts were originally created by Dr. A. V. Hershey while working
  at the U. S. National Bureau of Standards. They are in the public domain.

  The format of the font data in this distribution was originally created by
  James Hurt, Cognition, Inc., 900 Technology Park Drive, Billerica, MA 01821.

The full use terms are kept in
casemaker-app/src/engine/fonts/licenses/Hershey-PublicDomain.txt. The data is
used for any purpose under the public-domain terms above, with these
acknowledgements distributed alongside it, and is not converted into the
U.S. NTIS format. Source: https://github.com/kamalmostafa/hershey-fonts
(hershey-fonts/rowmans.jhf).

